    {
      "id": "declaration-primary-view-smoke-content",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Pass Procedure",
      "position": { "x": 120, "y": 400 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 340,
      "ports": [
        { "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Pass Procedure\n\n1. Create a fresh Declaration from the toolbar.\n2. Confirm six handles: **default view**, **summary view**, **icon view**, **glyph**, **port**, and **landing surface**. There must be no root or legacy side handles.\n3. Drag **default view**, **summary view**, and **icon view** into open space; each must create a View.\n4. Drag **glyph** into open space; it must create a Glyph Definition, not an Icon View.\n5. Drag **port** into open space more than once; each drag must create a Port.\n6. Drag **landing surface** into open space; it must create nothing and explain that the relationship connects to an existing node. Connect it to a focusable node instead.\n7. Save and reload. Confirm every relationship and handle remains in place.\n\nThe Declaration is the implicit root Port. Its default, summary, icon, and glyph relationships are required. Landing controls navigation independently. Explicit legacy `primary-view` and root declarations remain readable."
        },
        "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown" }
      }
    },
